  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Change**: rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Love Is a Long Road**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Like a Hurricane**: back after 32 archived shows (2978 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **From a Silver Phial**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Satellite of Love**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Who's That**: rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **Thinking of a Place**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n- **Lucy**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **twod2025-12-18.larryrulz** (recommended): source not stated; 19 songs; 145 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- 250 tickets sold out instantly; user received a spare ticket from a Redditor the day before the show [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **twod2025-12-18.larryrulz**: Recorded with CA-11 cardioid mic into Sony A10, processed in Audacity, transferred to TLH, encoded FLAC [1]",
